{"id": "86217", "name": "פירוק לגורמים – הפרש ריבועים של סוגריים (a+b)² − (a+c)² (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "Factorise the following:\n\\[ {{CT:0}}. \\] <br>\n[[input:ans]] [[validation:ans]]", "generalfeedback": "Although it would be possible to multiply out the brackets and then factorise, it is far simpler, and far less time consuming to peform two clever substitutions.\n\\[ u = a+b. \\]\n\\[ v = a+c.\\]\nThis gives:\n\\[ u^2-v^2, \\]\nwhich is now clearly a difference of two squares. So factorising gives:\n\\[ u^2-v^2 = \\left( u+v \\right) \\left( u-v \\right) = \\left( a+b+a+c \\right) \\left( a+b-a-c \\right) = \\left( 2a+b+c \\right) \\left( b-c \\right). \\]", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "FacForm", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": "a", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["ta"], "nvariants": 1}